Files changed from upstream:
  threestudio/systems/GassuianEditorEdit.py            propagation switches, pre-pass, geometry refresh, mask clamp, frozen SH, noise cap, seeding
  threestudio/models/guidance/instructpix2pix_guidance.py   latent paste of a composite during the early denoising steps, fixed timestep option
  .gitignore, readme.md                                 fork notes

Files added:
  propagation/geometry.py          projection, warp, visibility tests, composite
  propagation/priors.py            VGGT on a folder of images (runs in its own environment)
  threestudio/systems/propagation.py   scene priors, VGGT subprocess, overlap table, pre-pass order, per-refresh composite
  NOTICE                           this file

VGGT (https://github.com/facebookresearch/vggt) is not included; propagation/priors.py imports it
from a separate environment under its own licence.
